From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:50:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 47/49] dt-bindings: ufs: qcom,sc7180-ufshc: Add SM8475 UFS
 controller

The SM8475 UFS host controller is the SM8450 controller, but its core,
UniPro and ICE clocks run at up to 850 MHz. Above 300 MHz the controller
needs an SoC-specific turbo programming sequence, so the driver must be
able to tell the two SoCs apart.

Document "qcom,sm8475-ufshc" with "qcom,sm8450-ufshc" as fallback.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,sc7180-ufshc.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,sc7180-ufshc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,sc7180-ufshc.yaml
index 3c407426d697..80097ed08a26 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,sc7180-ufshc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/ufs/qcom,sc7180-ufshc.yaml
@@ -38,6 +38,11 @@ properties:
               - qcom,x1e80100-ufshc
           - const: qcom,sm8550-ufshc
           - const: qcom,ufshc
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,sm8475-ufshc
+          - const: qcom,sm8450-ufshc
+          - const: qcom,ufshc
+          - const: jedec,ufs-2.0
       - items:
           - enum:
               - qcom,milos-ufshc
